                "title": "Manhattan Plate with Egg and Dart Knob, Brass Accents D07-K358-EDG",
                "description": "Brass Accents D07-K358-EDG, Manhattan Plate with Egg and Dart Knob - The Manhattan Plate with Egg and Dart Knob is beautiful. The uniquely shaped plate paired with the fancy Egg and Dart Knob, make a latchset that is both elegant and timeless. It is available in a wide array of finishes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Manhattan Collection Plate with Egg and Dart Knob will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
